<title>INDIA: India's ITC Hotels 1996/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India's ITC Hotels 1996/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   370.50   vs   265.2</p>
<p>    Sales		1,307.1    vs 1,241.4</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	3.0    vs     2.75</p>
<p>    Other income	  14.7    vs    41.4</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  838.3    vs   792.2</p>
<p>    Interest		47.2    vs    91.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation	 421.6    vs   367.8</p>
<p>    Forex earnings     719.2    vs   672.3</p>
<p>Note : Hospitality firm ITC Hotels Ltd said the results were audited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
